@title The Lord of the Rings - The Return of the King (USA)
@file Lord of the Rings, The - The Return of the King (U) (M5).gba
@game BLRE
@chip EEPROM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: the game saves a hero only when a level is finished (Load Game lists four Empty slots after this route); the first level (Isengard, Aragorn with Gandalf) was not finished. The EEPROM written here holds the language only (21 bytes): on a reload dingbat-bios and mgba skip the language menu.

# English, logos, title, New Game, Aragorn, A through the Orthanc story,
# into the first level: Gandalf's lines, walk down-right past the barrels
# towards the ledge, sword swings on the way.
# Findings: nba does not read back its own 8 KB battery file (on a reload
# it shows the language menu again, the other two do not). Menu tab and
# logo fades land on different frames per emulator (EA logo f1532: all
# three differ; backpack tabs f3506..f3598 mid-transition).
[new]
wait 600
wait 60
checkpoint language window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 300
wait 300
press START
wait 200
press START
wait 200
checkpoint title window=30 compare=text
press START
wait 120
checkpoint main_menu window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 120
checkpoint select_hero window=30
press A
wait 180
press START
wait 200
press A
wait 120
tap A times=15 every=40 hold=4
checkpoint level1 window=30 compare=none
press RIGHT hold=60
tap A times=8 every=40 hold=4
press DOWN+RIGHT hold=120
tap A times=4 every=40 hold=4
press DOWN+RIGHT hold=120
checkpoint walking window=30 compare=none
press DOWN+RIGHT hold=150
tap A times=3 every=20 hold=4
press DOWN+RIGHT hold=150
checkpoint ledge window=30 compare=none
